(s543g scratch/s543g/probes/m5/f04_our_global.pl.)  Parser2::_fh_drop_flush_name answers for a VarAnnotator lexical or a binder `my`/`state` binding; a package variable's CL form is not `cl_sym(NAME)` (qualified names, foreign runtime globals), so the widening needs the variable's storage form (the `local` plan's _local_var_cl reading) and adds a type test at every `undef $global;` statement (`undef $@`, `$_ = undef`): measure that first.
